" and doesn't name the account. It could be Vantorre Group, but I can't confirm it.\n\n**Left out**\n- #4812 (EV charger bay conflicts, digest 2025-03-10) is Vantorre Mobility.\n- #PD-4402 (digest 2025-09-15) is Quillfeather Outfitters.\n- The 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01 and 2026-05-03 digests, the 8/3 digest and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre but name no ticket numbers. The 8/3 digest covers the Hartford incident without a ticket.\n\nThe 2025-03-10 digest mentions a Vantorre Group email from Mateo on 3/7 but gives no ticket number.\n\nI can only see what's in these channels and digests, not the support system itself. So this is the ticket history as mentioned in those places, and it may not be complete."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
